HOW TO READ THIS
  FORCED is the gate: it is the logit difference ATP differentiates,
  so a level is usable if forced-choice is at ceiling and roughly
  equal across mention orders. ARGMAX is the behavioural question --
  would a generation emit it -- and a large forced/argmax gap means
  the model prefers the right word but writes it in some other
  surface form. sysbare vs sysuser measures what the suppressed
  system block cost the existing runs; norule is the floor, where
  any forced-choice above 50%% is position or lexical bias.
  For off-distribution-ness read nll_prefix: the surprisal of the
  system block, rule and any developer message -- the part whose
